Check host prerequisites and service readiness

Usage
  axon preflight [OPTIONS]

Options
  --config                         Validate config cutover keys only; do not run service readiness probes
  --json                           Output results as machine-readable JSON
  --color <COLOR>                  Color output: auto (TTY detect, default), always, never Possible values: auto, always, never
  --tei-url <TEI_URL>              Text Embeddings Inference server URL (overrides TEI_URL)
  --qdrant-url <QDRANT_URL>        Qdrant server URL (overrides QDRANT_URL)
  --quiet                          Suppress spinners and progress output (useful in scripts). JSON data is unaffected
  -h, --help                       Print help
